    "updated_at": "2023-06-07T20:22:30Z",
    "body": "> What about the concerns @zcorpan raised with regards to minified code?\r\n\r\nI think it doesn't make sense to tighten the mitigation just for target attributes, if the URL parser is still checking for newlines and `<`. We should probably take that concern to https://github.com/whatwg/fetch/issues/546, and see if that's compatible in the URL parser mitigation first.",
